<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES STEADY TO LOWER.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES STEADY TO LOWER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates were</p>
<p>steady or lower at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on</p>
<p>Tuesday. The three-month rate was unchanged at 3.08 percent.</p>
<p>				  November 19 fix     November 18 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		   3.01 pct		3.01 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		   3.04 pct		3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		   3.08 pct		3.08 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		   3.20 pct		3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		   3.32 pct		3.33 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		  3.44 pct		3.44 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
